0..77 Comment "// Two comparisons that no budget decides, through `std.reals.Eff`. A stop of"
78..114 Comment "// the machine never reads as false."
115..117 Comment "//"
118..197 Comment "// `sqrt 2 < sqrt 2` fails, but no finite enclosure shows it. Each enclosure of"
198..276 Comment "// the left side overlaps each enclosure of the right side, so each pole stays"
277..354 Comment "// live. Each budget ends `exhausted`, and the machine never replies `fails`."
355..434 Comment "// `sqrt 2 · sqrt 2 < 2` fails too, but the certificate format has no rule for"
435..460 Comment "// a product of cuts yet."
461..463 Comment "//"
464..537 Comment "// So both poles of the product suspend before their first step, and each"
538..615 Comment "// budget ends `suspended`. `gandr run boundary.gandr` prints the verdicts of"
616..682 Comment "// each comparison at 1, 16 and 256 quanta, one comparison a line."
683..685 Comment "//"
686..761 Comment "// - see: `corpus/model/reals/comparison.gandr` — a comparison that holds"
762..837 Comment "// - see: `crates/surface-dispatcher/src/evaluate/reals/machine.rs` — the"
838..864 Comment "//   verdicts of a machine"
